--- !u!114 &4164782738126256487
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8955453270592770750}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5696e986b774d174288253524cd32523, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  targetTextThings:
  - Hello, I hope this email finds you well. You have asked me to invest into the
    stock market. I would appreciate it if you could provide me with a mentor or
    some assistance as this is very important and quite risky. I appreciate that
    you have selected me for the job. Thank you.
  - I still need to send the boss my work, I have completed a few spreadsheets and
    I have just started on making the presentation. I would really appreciate it
    if you could start to work on making the documentation. Could you also print
    out some extra information please. Thanks.
  - I am in trouble, I was in debt and I went to this fishy guy who told me he could
    remove the debt and all I would need to do is pay him back, but I am in a really
    bad situation. I am in so much debt and I dont know what to do. I am only going
    deeper into this pit and I can not get out.
  - I was doing some research on these things called loan sharks and man they are
    really dangerous, not that I know any. They charge really high interest rates
    and often turn to some form of violence if they do not receive money. I would
    call the police but, he knows my family.
  - Hello Dizzy Dishes, I am writing to thank you for taking the time to accept my
    application. I am honoured to start working for you. This is such a great opportunity
    for me. I will work my hardest as a way to repay my thanks to you. I dont think
    you understand how grateful I am for this chance. Thank you.
  - Hey fih, I found this casino that has this pretty cool slot machine, and it has
    pretty good odds, you could probably earn more from it then actually working
    in these jobs, but there is this weird 6 symbol, not too sure what it does but
    my guess is that you do not want to land on it otherwise it could probably be
    quite bad.
  - Hello Kelpy, Head management has informed me that you have just been employed
    into the stock market section. I need to tell you how to do it. It is quite simple,
    all you have to do is choose whether to sell or invest in stock. You will know
    what to do based on those annoying pop ups, pay attention to some of them before
    spamming the close button. Goodluck.
  - This place does not feel real, I feel like I am in a game being controlled, being
    forced to type this out, this specific email is going nowhere, it is weird, it
    is like whenever I want to make a decision myself, I can not. I feel like a puppet
    in some sort of way.
  - "This email is getting sent to nobody, you will type it out, press send and earn
    me money, I really appreciate it. You are trying to help me and sure it will
    work at first, but I represent the fraction of society that can\u2019t escape
    debt and end up tying themselves into a contract they can\u2019t get out of without
    the threat of harm."
  - Hey brock, I have these random words in my head and I have no idea what they
    mean, as you are part of the higher stock team, I wanted to learn if these could
    be potential crypto-currencies. FMP, that sounds important. Distinction? I am
    really not sure, Thank you for looking into it, I am eager for your response!
    Thanks.
  - Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor
    incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud
    exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute
    irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat
    nulla pariatur.
  - She considered the fish to be her friends. She would put out food for them each
    morning and then she wouldd watch as they swam to the food to fulfil themselves
    for the day. She wondered what they would do if something ever happened to her.
    Would they miss the meals she provided if she failed to put out the food one
    morning?
  - 'Cake or pie? I can tell a lot about you by which one you pick. It may seem silly,
    but cake people and pie people are really different. I know which one I hope
    you are, but that''s not for me to decide. So, what is it? Cake or pie? '
  targetText: 
  displayText: {fileID: 3638907637536613023}
  inputText: {fileID: 7643053686241036498}
